  DRUP["EXTERNAL_SERVICE Drupal JSON:API (neruds.org)"]

  SECTORS -->|NAVIGATES_TO| LIST
  SECTORS -->|NAVIGATES_TO| TAX
  SECTORS -->|NAVIGATES_TO| MOD
  SECTORS -->|NAVIGATES_TO| USERS
